01:16:40.708 --> 01:16:42.538
My name is Ed Galbraith.


01:16:42.625 --> 01:16:45.245
I own Best Quality Vacuum,


01:16:45.333 --> 01:16:48.463
2714, 4th Street.


01:16:49.208 --> 01:16:50.628
Northwest. That's correct.


01:16:51.375 --> 01:16:55.125
