they'd call you back immediately.


01:18:10.666 --> 01:18:12.786
But, hey, guess what?


01:18:12.875 --> 01:18:15.785
Seriously, yo. Pathetic.


01:18:18.125 --> 01:18:20.785
Wow, you got to love that response time.


01:18:23.875 --> 01:18:24.875
Take your money.


01:18:39.000 --> 01:18:41.920
Officers, thank you very much
for getting here so fast.


01:18:42.000 --> 01:18:44.380
- He obviously heard my call and...
