01:18:44.458 --> 01:18:46.828
No, he's not, he's gone. I, uh...


01:18:47.125 --> 01:18:49.915
Uh, he was spooked by my phone call


01:18:50.000 --> 01:18:52.330
and he headed up northbound, uh...


01:18:53.458 --> 01:18:55.458
