- Uh, sure I can.


01:18:57.666 --> 01:18:58.666
He was, uh...


01:18:59.333 --> 01:19:01.293
young, uh, he's white,


01:19:01.375 --> 01:19:03.245
skinny, very tall guy.


01:19:03.333 --> 01:19:04.923
Six-five, six-six.


01:19:05.083 --> 01:19:07.333
