01:20:56.541 --> 01:20:59.251
Yes. It's the right thing to do.


01:20:59.625 --> 01:21:01.665
Quit running and get some help.


01:21:01.750 --> 01:21:03.540
No one is trying to hurt you, son.


01:21:03.625 --> 01:21:07.745
Better you come forward on your own,
it'll be safer for you, better all around.


01:21:07.833 --> 01:21:10.713
You remember where
