01:27:21.416 --> 01:27:23.126
Nah, man, don't go by junkyards.


01:27:23.208 --> 01:27:24.788
There's like 50 junkyards.


01:27:25.208 --> 01:27:26.538
The rebar place is what...


01:27:27.708 --> 01:27:28.708
Yeah, the re...


01:27:30.500 --> 01:27:31.880
Yeah, exactly.


01:27:33.333 --> 01:27:34.333
That's the one.


01:27:34.583 --> 01:27:35.583
Turn there.


01:27:36.625 --> 01:27:38.745
Yeah. Straight down on the right.


01:27:38.833 --> 01:27:39.923
Look for the sign.


01:27:43.291 --> 01:27:45.171
Oh, yeah, I got you.


01:27:57.458 --> 01:27:59.128
They're here!


01:27:59.625 --> 01:28:03.075
Woo hoo! All right!


01:28:07.541 --> 01:28:10.211
Yeah, okay. Oh, my God.


01:28:12.416 --> 01:28:14.126
Yeah.


01:28:14.208 --> 01:28:15.078
Woo!


01:28:15.166 --> 01:28:16.767
- Keep your mouth shut.
- All right.


01:28:16.791 --> 01:28:18.017
- All right.
- Oh, shit.


01:28:18.041 --> 01:28:21.081
- Oh, shit.
- That's a big, big boy.


01:28:21.166 --> 01:28:23.076
This guy's bigger than your mom, Sean.


01:28:23.166 --> 01:28:24.626
Who's Kandy?


01:28:25.250 --> 01:28:26.500
Yeah, that's me.


01:28:27.125 --> 01:28:30.495
The car's too small for you.
$750 an hour, cash up front.


01:28:30.583 --> 01:28:32.463
Oh, man. The perks are extra.


01:28:32.541 --> 01:28:33.791
Well, by all means.


01:28:34.125 --> 01:28:36.205
- I get the first perk.
- We want the perks.


01:28:36.666 --> 01:28:38.326
Perks, perks! Yeah!


01:28:38.416 --> 01:28:40.916
- Don't we, boys? Yeah?
- We want the perks!


01:28:41.000 --> 01:28:43.040
- Perks!
- Got any perks in there?


01:28:43.416 --> 01:28:45.286
Oh, my God!


01:28:45.375 --> 01:28:46.915
That's what I'm talking about.


01:28:47.208 --> 01:28:49.628
- Gentlemen, hi.
- That's a good start. And hello to you.


01:28:49.708 --> 01:28:51.468
- Hello to you.
- Hi, welcome.


01:28:51.500 --> 01:28:53.559
- Where have you been all my life?
- Excuse me.


01:28:53.583 --> 01:28:55.793
Oh, just waiting for you
in this little car.


01:28:55.875 --> 01:28:59.075
- Oh, I'm here, baby, don't worry.
- Please, come right this way.


01:29:00.083 --> 01:29:01.833
Careful, careful now.


01:29:01.916 --> 01:29:04.286
Should've brought your work boots.


01:29:04.416 --> 01:29:06.476
Well, nobody told me
it was gonna be yucky.


01:29:06.500 --> 01:29:07.710
My name is Casey.


01:29:08.500 --> 01:29:10.330
I never really go for redheads.


01:29:34.916 --> 01:29:35.916
All right.


01:29:36.625 --> 01:29:37.625
Done.


01:29:37.833 --> 01:29:39.213
Bullshit you're done.


01:29:39.291 --> 01:29:40.971
You've been here 20 minutes,
what'd you do?


01:29:41.000 --> 01:29:42.830
Added a fishplate up here,


01:29:43.416 --> 01:29:45.166
one in the middle, one down at the end.


01:29:45.250 --> 01:29:46.330
Added a what?


01:29:46.416 --> 01:29:47.416
A fishplate.


01:29:47.500 --> 01:29:49.750
What, like a... plate of fish?


01:29:50.333 --> 01:29:52.101
What the fuck is that?
Is that even a real word?


01:29:52.125 --> 01:29:53.915
Look, man, I want more of those things,


01:29:54.000 --> 01:29:57.040
the sideway diagonal things,
like twice as many.


01:29:57.541 --> 01:29:58.581
Those are gussets.


01:29:59.833 --> 01:30:01.333
You got enough of 'em already.


01:30:02.041 --> 01:30:05.711
Okay, yeah. So, gussets I got out the ass,
but a fishplate I need 'cause... What?


01:30:05.791 --> 01:30:07.421
I'm Catholic and it's Friday?


01:30:08.375 --> 01:30:12.705
You sure you couldn't just
put a few more gussets up there, Neil?


01:30:13.083 --> 01:30:14.713
I mean, what could it hurt, right?


01:30:14.791 --> 01:30:16.171
Hey, it's your money.


01:30:16.250 --> 01:30:18.050
But what I just did,
you don't even need that.


01:30:18.333 --> 01:30:20.517
I told you I built this thing right.


01:30:20.541 --> 01:30:24.331
Look, bro, I'm not like impugning
on your precious welding skills.


01:30:25.208 --> 01:30:28.708
It's just we have a, uh,
unique situation here.


01:30:38.541 --> 01:30:40.381
Tried to rabbit on us once already.


01:30:41.791 --> 01:30:44.461
I'm thinking he's gonna figure out a way
to break this thing.


01:30:45.041 --> 01:30:46.041
You kidding me?


01:30:46.541 --> 01:30:47.541
Him?


01:30:47.666 --> 01:30:50.956
Yeah, it's just I kinda feel it flexing
a little bit. A bit right here, look.


01:30:54.291 --> 01:30:56.541
Yeah, see? Right there.
Yeah, a little bit.


01:30:56.750 --> 01:30:59.290
Yeah, I don't see jack shit flexing.


01:30:59.666 --> 01:31:01.536
That's four-inch channel iron up there.


01:31:01.625 --> 01:31:03.125
You could hang an F150 from it


01:31:03.208 --> 01:31:05.788
and shove it back and forth
like a beach ball.


01:31:05.875 --> 01:31:06.875
It's going nowhere.


01:31:06.958 --> 01:31:10.918
Okay, you and your big four inches.
It's just this little bastard's wiry.


01:31:11.000 --> 01:31:14.000
I don't care how wiry he is.
Have him knock himself out.


01:31:16.458 --> 01:31:17.458
Oh, yeah?


01:31:18.000 --> 01:31:19.670
Wanna put your money
where your mouth is?


01:31:22.291 --> 01:31:25.001
Fifty bucks says he breaks this thing
right here, right now.


01:31:25.083 --> 01:31:26.423
Fifty, plus,


01:31:27.125 --> 01:31:30.705
then you got to put up more of those...
What'd you call 'em, gussets?


01:31:30.791 --> 01:31:31.831
No charge.


01:31:32.166 --> 01:31:34.206
Throw in some fishplates too,
while you're at it.


01:31:35.583 --> 01:31:36.793
You're on.


01:31:36.875 --> 01:31:37.955
- I'm on, huh?
- Mm-hmm.


01:31:38.041 --> 01:31:40.751
All right, all right.
Get that shit out the way and watch this.


01:31:41.375 --> 01:31:42.625
All right, good-lookin'.


01:31:42.875 --> 01:31:45.125
This is it. This is the acid test.


01:31:45.875 --> 01:31:46.875
Go for it.


01:31:48.916 --> 01:31:51.626
Now! Go, go, go! Come on!


01:31:52.416 --> 01:31:54.166
Faster! Hit it hard!


01:31:55.833 --> 01:31:57.543
All right, all right.
Other way, other way.


01:31:57.625 --> 01:32:00.495
Hey, what are you slowing down for?
Hit it!


01:32:02.791 --> 01:32:04.101
All right, come on, get up.


01:32:04.125 --> 01:32:06.785
I got 50 bucks riding on you.
I got to eat this month.


01:32:06.875 --> 01:32:10.375
Kenny, if he breaks his leg,
he's not gonna be able to cook.


01:32:10.625 --> 01:32:13.625
What, are you the fucking HR department?
Jesus, Toddie, relax.


01:32:14.458 --> 01:32:16.538
We're gonna even up the odds a little bit.


01:32:18.333 --> 01:32:19.253
All right.


01:32:19.333 --> 01:32:20.713
Okay.


01:32:21.750 --> 01:32:23.080
Now, I believe in you.


01:32:23.333 --> 01:32:25.423
You're gonna John Henry this bitch, yeah?


01:32:25.500 --> 01:32:26.500
Now go.


01:32:26.583 --> 01:32:28.383
Go, go, go! Let's go!


01:32:28.458 --> 01:32:31.128
Go, go, go, go! Yeah!


01:32:32.875 --> 01:32:33.875
Woo!


01:32:33.916 --> 01:32:36.956
All right, other way. Faster!
Hit it hard!


01:32:37.041 --> 01:32:38.251
Yeah, baby!


01:32:38.375 --> 01:32:40.205
Yeah! Caught some air.


01:32:43.291 --> 01:32:45.421
Yeah!


01:32:45.875 --> 01:32:47.325
Todd, who is this guy anyway?


01:32:47.916 --> 01:32:48.916
What'd he do?


01:32:49.583 --> 01:32:50.583
Uh...


01:32:50.666 --> 01:32:53.626
It's... It's kind of a long story.


01:32:54.000 --> 01:32:55.000
Yeah.


01:32:55.291 --> 01:32:56.381
He's a rat.


01:32:58.666 --> 01:33:00.376
That's all you need to know.


01:33:33.250 --> 01:33:35.184
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Hey, hey!
- Okay, guys.


01:33:35.208 --> 01:33:37.392
- We dancing or what?
- You paid till three


01:33:37.416 --> 01:33:38.706
and it's five past.


01:33:39.500 --> 01:33:41.830
Hell, I'll go another hour.
Come on, we all will.


01:33:42.958 --> 01:33:44.498
Where you going? Huh?


01:33:44.750 --> 01:33:46.580
- Come on.
- Wanda!


01:33:48.333 --> 01:33:51.583
Hey, Wanda!


01:33:51.875 --> 01:33:55.075
Wanda!


01:33:55.458 --> 01:33:57.128
Would you stop? You're crazy.


01:33:57.208 --> 01:33:58.328
Ya Opie-lookin' self.


01:34:06.041 --> 01:34:08.921
We'll see you next week.
In your dreams, buddy.


01:34:11.583 --> 01:34:14.753
Just wanna go home,
get in my bed,


01:34:15.583 --> 01:34:16.923
cuddle with my dog.


01:34:17.458 --> 01:34:18.828
I am exhausted.


01:34:18.916 --> 01:34:21.276
I'm never coming back
to this dump place again.


01:34:22.541 --> 01:34:24.501
My feet hurt.


01:34:25.041 --> 01:34:27.041
Wake up, Clarence, let's go.


01:34:27.583 --> 01:34:30.583
Look at my fucking shoes. I know.
This is a mess.


01:34:30.666 --> 01:34:32.666
It wasn't even worth it.


01:34:32.791 --> 01:34:35.131
It's gonna take me hours
to get the mud out.


01:34:36.458 --> 01:34:37.828
Wait for me!


01:35:08.125 --> 01:35:09.705
I said, "My son",


01:35:10.208 --> 01:35:12.668
cocaine wasn't even invented
when Brigham Young was born.


01:35:12.750 --> 01:35:14.540
"It's okay, you can have some."


01:35:15.000 --> 01:35:17.750
Come on, come to papa. There we go.


01:35:17.833 --> 01:35:20.753
- You'll never get that back.
- There he goes.


01:35:20.833 --> 01:35:23.463
- Black diamond.
- Bye-bye, cocaine.


01:35:23.541 --> 01:35:25.081
He's all cocaine and Mormons.


01:36:02.666 --> 01:36:03.666
What's up?


01:36:04.041 --> 01:36:05.211
I need more money.


01:36:06.375 --> 01:36:07.375
Oh, yeah?


01:36:08.500 --> 01:36:11.500
That three-way split
didn't quite cover it for me.


01:36:12.333 --> 01:36:14.673
I'd appreciate you helping me out.


01:36:15.041 --> 01:36:17.671
Well, what's he talking about?
Three-way split?


01:36:17.750 --> 01:36:20.000
You mean there was a third more?


01:36:20.083 --> 01:36:21.253
And you gave it to him?


01:36:22.291 --> 01:36:23.961
It's a long story.


01:36:24.833 --> 01:36:25.923
Well...


01:36:26.041 --> 01:36:27.251
What long story?


01:36:27.333 --> 01:36:29.833
When I left,
he didn't even have a fucking gun.


01:36:29.916 --> 01:36:31.626
Well, he's got one now, doesn't he?


01:36:32.208 --> 01:36:34.748
So, you know, shut up. Let me handle this.


01:36:34.958 --> 01:36:36.538
Neil, who the hell is this guy?


01:36:36.625 --> 01:36:38.955
Yeah, I can't believe you just
let him walk in here with...


01:36:39.041 --> 01:36:40.961
"Shut up" means everybody.


01:36:45.333 --> 01:36:46.333
Now,


01:36:46.791 --> 01:36:49.751
how exactly do you plan
on pulling this off?


01:36:50.666 --> 01:36:53.376
I mean, being that there's five of us
and one of you.


01:36:55.541 --> 01:36:57.291
I'm not here to rob you.


01:36:57.791 --> 01:36:59.041
Oh, you're not?


01:37:00.458 --> 01:37:01.668
Then how's this work?


01:37:04.375 --> 01:37:05.825
All I need is $1,800.


01:37:06.875 --> 01:37:08.205
I'm asking as a...


01:37:08.875 --> 01:37:09.875
a favor.


01:37:10.083 --> 01:37:11.583
Oh, what, like charity?


01:37:11.666 --> 01:37:15.286
Seems to me this silly son of a bitch
already forked over, big time.


01:37:15.375 --> 01:37:17.245
Casey, seriously, shut up.


01:37:18.625 --> 01:37:20.245
$1,800, huh?


01:37:21.458 --> 01:37:23.168
Why not an even two grand?


01:37:23.250 --> 01:37:24.880
You know, nice round number.


01:37:24.958 --> 01:37:26.378
$1,800 is all I need.


01:37:27.500 --> 01:37:30.170
So, what's the gun for?
It's like personal protection?


01:37:31.458 --> 01:37:33.458
I mean, is that a...


01:37:35.000 --> 01:37:37.540
What is that? Let me see that thing.
Show me.


01:37:39.916 --> 01:37:42.996
Oh, my God, is that a .22?


01:37:43.833 --> 01:37:45.583
You brought a .22?


01:37:45.875 --> 01:37:46.875
Jesus!


01:37:46.958 --> 01:37:49.038
Where'd you get that thing?


01:37:49.125 --> 01:37:50.875
I think it was my grandfather's.


01:37:50.958 --> 01:37:52.628
Oh, well, it's adorable.


01:37:52.708 --> 01:37:54.708
I know we got empty beer cans around here


01:37:54.916 --> 01:37:56.286
if you wanna do some plinking?


01:38:00.500 --> 01:38:01.580
Eighteen hundred.


01:38:02.208 --> 01:38:03.458
I'm gone forever.


01:38:04.166 --> 01:38:05.326
Simple as that.


01:38:05.583 --> 01:38:09.503
Neil, I swear to God, if you give
this piece of shit one more dollar...


01:38:35.708 --> 01:38:36.918
Cold out here.


01:38:40.958 --> 01:38:41.958
Tell you what.


01:38:44.333 --> 01:38:48.133
My third is in a duffel bag
in the top drawer of that file cabinet.


01:38:50.583 --> 01:38:51.753
Where's yours?


01:38:54.583 --> 01:38:55.633
In my car.


01:38:56.416 --> 01:38:57.626
Parked up the street.


01:38:58.041 --> 01:38:59.081
What do you say...


01:39:02.125 --> 01:39:03.285
your .22...


01:39:03.958 --> 01:39:05.458
against my .45?


01:39:07.250 --> 01:39:08.420
Winner takes all.


01:39:08.916 --> 01:39:11.576
- Like the Wild West?
- Yeah.


01:39:12.375 --> 01:39:13.825
Like the Wild West.


01:39:14.666 --> 01:39:16.826
What? Come on.


01:39:22.958 --> 01:39:24.378
Jesus! Neil?


01:39:24.875 --> 01:39:27.245
- Come on, man, I didn't mean this...
- Casey.


01:39:27.833 --> 01:39:30.333
Shut the fuck up.


01:39:32.083 --> 01:39:35.043
- I'm not gonna get in another...
- No, wait, you go... Oh!


01:39:36.041 --> 01:39:37.041
Shoot!


01:39:41.583 --> 01:39:42.633
You ready?


01:39:45.583 --> 01:39:46.583
Yeah.


01:40:54.333 --> 01:40:55.333
Hey, don't shoot.


01:40:55.791 --> 01:40:57.041
All right. Get over here.


01:40:57.541 --> 01:40:59.541
- Please.
- All right, get up!


01:41:04.000 --> 01:41:05.000
All right.


01:41:05.666 --> 01:41:06.786
Give me your license.


01:41:08.416 --> 01:41:10.576
- Driver's license, do it!
- Yes.


01:41:17.041 --> 01:41:18.251
I got kids.


01:41:18.500 --> 01:41:19.960
Like I give a shit.


01:41:21.208 --> 01:41:22.208
All right.


01:41:22.708 --> 01:41:23.878
Sean,


01:41:24.333 --> 01:41:25.333
Kyle,


01:41:26.333 --> 01:41:27.333
Colin.


01:41:27.833 --> 01:41:29.213
I know where you live.


01:41:30.000 --> 01:41:31.630
You tell the cops about me,


01:41:31.958 --> 01:41:35.418
and I am coming
for every goddamn one of you.


01:41:36.541 --> 01:41:38.291
- You understand?
- Yeah.


01:41:42.208 --> 01:41:43.208
Go.


01:41:43.916 --> 01:41:44.916
Go!


01:41:51.416 --> 01:41:52.706
Dude, you're on fire.


01:43:23.291 --> 01:43:24.671
Ah.


01:43:41.500 --> 01:43:42.920
Of course I miss you.


01:43:46.125 --> 01:43:48.495
Yeah? Well...


01:43:49.250 --> 01:43:50.750
do you miss me?


01:43:55.375 --> 01:43:56.375
I don't know.


01:43:57.791 --> 01:44:00.251
How you...
How are you gonna convince me?


01:45:02.041 --> 01:45:03.581
Yeah, bitch.


01:45:17.000 --> 01:45:18.670
- Ah.
- Thank you.


01:45:19.416 --> 01:45:20.746
Leave the pitcher, would ya?


01:45:21.166 --> 01:45:23.376
- Sorry, can't really do that.
- W... wait.


01:45:28.083 --> 01:45:29.083
Sure you can.


01:45:34.833 --> 01:45:35.923
Wow.


01:45:36.333 --> 01:45:39.173
- It's like I'm here with Sinatra.
- I know, right?


01:45:42.041 --> 01:45:44.081
Certainly went big with the pineapple.


01:45:44.416 --> 01:45:46.456
Only an asshole
doesn't like pineapple.


01:45:47.250 --> 01:45:48.380
Guessing you don't?


01:45:49.041 --> 01:45:50.581
I can take it or leave it.


01:45:51.416 --> 01:45:53.876
Pineapple's good for you.
It's got bromide.


01:45:53.958 --> 01:45:55.038
Bromelain.


01:45:55.625 --> 01:45:56.825
But, close.


01:45:58.208 --> 01:46:00.038
Actually, it's not close at all.


01:46:00.208 --> 01:46:02.288
Are you gonna eat?
You should really eat something.


01:46:02.375 --> 01:46:03.875
No, I'm eating. I'll eat.


01:46:03.958 --> 01:46:05.458
Gotta eat, got to hydrate.


01:46:05.541 --> 01:46:07.541
Get those electrolytes
you were talking about.


01:46:07.625 --> 01:46:09.825
- Your sodium, you know, all that shit.
- Good, yeah.


01:46:11.750 --> 01:46:12.750
Yeah.


01:46:19.000 --> 01:46:20.000
Hey.


01:46:20.750 --> 01:46:23.040
- He's all right.
- I'm fine, thank you.


01:46:23.541 --> 01:46:24.961
- You all right?
- I'm fine. Good.


01:46:25.041 --> 01:46:26.171
- Sit down.
- All right.


01:46:42.541 --> 01:46:44.631
How long will it take to sell this batch?


01:46:47.833 --> 01:46:49.253
- Six months.
- Jeez...


01:46:49.333 --> 01:46:50.463
Easy. Maybe more.


01:46:51.000 --> 01:46:53.540
There's no one that you can think of
who might...


01:46:53.958 --> 01:46:55.128
buy the entire amount?


01:46:55.208 --> 01:46:58.668
Uh, someone with a spare $1.3 million
lying around? No.


01:46:59.208 --> 01:47:00.498
Can't say that I do.


01:47:06.041 --> 01:47:10.291
Your family is gonna get every dime
they got coming to them, Mr. White.


01:47:11.291 --> 01:47:12.921
No matter how long it takes.


01:47:19.583 --> 01:47:21.923
- Hydrate. Seriously.
- Yeah.


01:47:30.875 --> 01:47:32.915
What about you, Jesse? Hm?


01:47:33.708 --> 01:47:36.208
Huh? After this. What then?


01:47:39.291 --> 01:47:41.331
Nothing? What about college?


01:47:42.958 --> 01:47:46.458
No, what is stopping you
from going to college?


01:47:47.000 --> 01:47:48.000
Um...


01:47:49.250 --> 01:47:51.500
- Nothing, I guess.
- Yeah, nothing at all.


01:47:52.250 --> 01:47:54.960
- Say you went to college.
- Uh-huh...


01:47:55.250 --> 01:47:57.670
What would you study, you think, eh?


01:47:58.208 --> 01:47:59.208
What interests you?


01:48:02.250 --> 01:48:03.420
Sports Medicine?


01:48:05.000 --> 01:48:06.170
Sports Medicine.


01:48:06.583 --> 01:48:07.583
Yeah.


01:48:08.666 --> 01:48:10.996
That's... Yeah, sure. That's...


01:48:11.583 --> 01:48:12.883
Yeah. Could...


01:48:13.625 --> 01:48:16.415
Or... Business. Hm?


